&lt;p&gt;This is my semi-regular show hosted and produced by yours truly. I&amp;rsquo;m very excited for this line-up:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Chanel Ali
Freddy G
Ethan Filler
Shannon Keye&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You can grab tickets &lt;a href=&#34;https://qedastoria.com/products/vinnydotcomedy&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noreferrer&#34;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

