&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A showcase hosted by Amber Born (to be seen on Jeopardy on July 3rd!) and Anant Kumar. It&amp;rsquo;s in the basement of Spicy Moon, a vegan Szechuan restaurant. Comedy takes you to the most interesting of basements. You&amp;rsquo;ll be able to order food and drinks for your table before the show, which is neat&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You can grab tickets &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.eventbrite.com/e/double-a-comedy-show-june-24th-tickets-1990878929471&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noreferrer&#34;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

