    &lt;/span&gt;
    
&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I&amp;rsquo;m fortunate to be featured in the 6th Annual Hill People&amp;rsquo;s Comedy Festival in Stamford, NY. The festival actually starts on Thursday, with a showcase of local comedians. Friday night at 7 PM is a showcase of all the festival participants (myself included).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Saturday night&amp;rsquo;s show will feature the festival&amp;rsquo;s headliner, Mia Jackson, for whom I will be featuring. You can grab tickets/passes to all the festivals events &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.zeffy.com/en-US/ticketing/6th-annual-hill-peoples-comedy-fest&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noreferrer&#34;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;That&amp;rsquo;s all I&amp;rsquo;ve got for you now. Thanks for checking in!&lt;/p&gt;
